  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMIGAN HOPE EMPOWERMENT INITIATIVE CLIMATE ACTION INTERVENTIONS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entitled &#x2018;Conflict Resolution and Climate Action Interventions for Conflict-Affected and Vulnerable Female-Headed Households in Bassa LGA, Plateau State&#x2019; is specifically targeting 120 vulnerable female-headed households of Mianga and Rikwechongu in Bassa LGA, Plateau State displaced by farmer-herder conflict by providing resources to rebuild lost livestock, trainings to enable sustainable vegetable gardening, and promote climate-resilient agricultural practices including renewable energy-powered irrigation and organic farming.</narrative>
  </description>
